1: /**
2:  * server/hls-proxy.js
3:  * 
4:  * High-performance HLS Manifest Rewriter & fMP4 Media Segment Streaming Proxy.
5:  * Built with Node.js built-ins for LG webOS TV (webOS 8.5.0, Chromium ~108+).
6:  * 
7:  * Features:
8:  * - Injects Origin: https://cinejoy.pk and Referer: https://cinejoy.pk/ headers.
9:  * - Rewrites master and variant playlists (M3U8) with absolute URL resolution.
10:  * - Zero-buffering Web Stream piping for fMP4 (.png) chunks.
11:  * - Full Range request support (206 Partial Content).
12:  * - Transparent redirect resolution and AbortController lifecycle management.
13:  */
